WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:03.110
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:09.150
Today I am going to explain a Russian comedy
Sci Fi film called “The (UN)perfect Guy.”

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.150
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.019
Watch out and take care!

00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:20.760
A 
young Russian woman named Sveta lives in a

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.710
small apartment with her boyfriend Borya.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:29.260
Sveta has recently left her job at a car showroom
and is currently interviewing for a job at

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.869
a multi-million robotic company.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:37.420
Her potential boss Vadim Sergeevich, is impressed
by her intelligence and appoints her in his

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.239
company as a manager for the next launch.

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:43.449
Sveta is beyond happy while returning home.

00:00:43.449 --> 00:00:49.069
She walks into her physical trainer and influencer
boyfriend Borya working out in her kitchen.

00:00:49.069 --> 00:00:53.160
Sveta picks up on Borya’s weird behavior
but doesn’t say anything.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:59.019
A noise is heard from the bathroom which Borya
claims is a client, but his lie is soon caught

00:00:59.019 --> 00:01:01.840
when a girl with only a towel comes out of
it.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.850
Sveta looks at her boyfriend with teary eyes
as he makes up excuses.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:12.210
She also notices him hiding a packet of contraception
on the floor but doesn't call him out for

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.210
it.

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:18.050
Borya is clearly cheating on her but Sveta
is too emotionally attached to him, to let

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.479
him go.

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:24.299
After the woman leaves, Borya cooks breakfast
for them as an awkward silence prevails in

00:01:24.299 --> 00:01:25.430
the kitchen.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:30.340
Having had enough of Sveta’s silence, he
asks her to speak and curse him because he

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.409
deserves it.

00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:36.100
Sveta still insists nothing is wrong with
their relationship which makes Borya even

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.600
more furious.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:41.799
He hands her a slipper, urging her to hit
him, but she declines.

00:01:41.799 --> 00:01:46.140
Things get heated when he starts to bang his
head to the fridge and throws his dumbbell

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:47.549
off the balcony.

00:01:47.549 --> 00:01:51.860
It lands on someone’s car and the couple
is called downstairs to pay for it.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.590
Borya begins arguing with the man even though
it was his fault.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:02:02.289
When Sveta stops him, he declares that they
have broken up and leaves.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:07.899
Sveta is devastated, her mood from the morning
changes entirely and she begins to cry.

00:02:07.899 --> 00:02:10.789
The following day is her first day at work.

00:02:10.789 --> 00:02:14.870
Her coworker Vit explains everything she has
to do throughout the day.

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:20.000
Her first task is to unpack the human-like
androids, sync them with their tablets, and

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.900
ask them for their model number.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:26.409
Once the number matches, she has to scan the
barcode behind their ears and send them to

00:02:26.409 --> 00:02:29.290
room number twentyone for diagnosis.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:34.239
The androids are so similar to humans that
one can not differentiate between them.

00:02:34.239 --> 00:02:39.019
The company has given them all their own personality
and a specific thing they are good at so the

00:02:39.019 --> 00:02:41.909
consumers could buy one according to their
need.

00:02:41.909 --> 00:02:45.970
The first box that Sveta opens is a well-built
fitness trainer.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:49.850
Sveta carefully takes the tablet from beside
him and links him to it.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:55.110
His neck, which was made of iron till now,
starts to transform to look like a human.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:58.549
When the robot opens its eyes, it startles
Sveta.

00:02:58.549 --> 00:03:02.590
She is confused about what she should do next
but the smart robot briefs her.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:06.099
Sveta does as he says and sends him for evaluation.

00:03:06.099 --> 00:03:10.140
Next, she opens a box with a beautiful model
inside it.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.849
She, too, is as smart as the first guy.

00:03:12.849 --> 00:03:17.250
By her third time, Sveta gets a hang of the
job and does it efficiently.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:21.870
She unpacks a cook, a political leader, a
maid, and other robots.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:26.100
However, her skills are tested when a box
with a “friend” doesn’t want to tell

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.739
her his model number.

00:03:27.739 --> 00:03:32.069
He refuses to get up and says that he just
had a really horrible dream.

00:03:32.069 --> 00:03:36.920
Sveta believes that he might have a defect
and asks him to go to the evacuation room

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:40.290
but he states that he is scared and hugs her.

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:43.440
She calls Vit and informs him about the situation.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:47.220
He almost doesn’t believe her until he sees
the friend for himself.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:51.489
On checking, he finds out that the friend
has the error number 102.

00:03:51.489 --> 00:03:55.890
The robot is scared because this might mean
they will demolish him to create a new and

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.120
better robot.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.180
He starts to cry about how short his life
was.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:05.030
Even while crying, he compliments Sveta’s
beauty because he cannot help it; flirting

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:10.519
and being friendly is coded in his program.

00:04:10.519 --> 00:04:15.519
Their boss Vadim Sergeevich is called for
the final verdict of the situation.

00:04:15.519 --> 00:04:20.350
He wants to send the defective one back to
Japan but Sveta retaliates, saying that they

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:22.590
can sell him at a discount because of the
defect.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:28.400
Vadim Sergeevich agrees and asks her to prepare
the robots for the potential clients.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:32.230
Following that, they are kept on platforms
for an exhibition so the clients can chat

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:34.560
with them and decide which one to get.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:38.790
Sveta is nervous because she has to present
the robots to the clients.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:42.870
She tells the friend that her confidence is
low because her boyfriend just broke up with

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:48.340
her but he assures her she will do great.

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:53.810
A wealthy woman comes looking for a suitable
robot and Sveta introduces her to the friend.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:58.020
She is skeptical about buying him at first
but changes her mind when he flatters her

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.590
with several compliments.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:04.760
However, while trying to win her acceptance,
the friend starts getting weirdly sexual.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:10.120
Yet, the woman asks Sveta to pack him up until
she comes to pick him up.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.950
Later, when Sveta is working on her computer,
the friend approaches her and apologizes for

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:20.250
his inappropriate jokes.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:25.310
He also thanks her for being such a good salesperson
and compliments her talent.

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:29.840
As they talk, he suggests she buy him so they
can be good friends forever.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.810
Sveta laughs and claims that he is out of
her budget.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:37.440
The friend reveals that he cracked the inappropriate
joke on purpose because if he was selected,

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.340
he would never meet her again.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:45.600
Then, he gets closer to Sveta and kisses her
on the lips but she immediately backs up.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:48.660
At last, they share an awkward hug and separate.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:53.210
The next day, the company holds a runway show
to display all the robots.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:56.980
The show is a success and most of them are
sold out quickly.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:02.000
At the end of the day, Vadim Sergeevich is
drunk and cannot drive home himself.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.390
Vit offers to drive Vadim Sergeevich and Sveta
to their houses.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:11.460
On their way home, Vit invites Sveta to a
concert that is four months away.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.970
It is evident that he has started to like
her.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.210
They sing songs throughout the journey.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:20.280
When they reach Sveta’s apartment, Vadim
Sergeevich insists on taking her to her room

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.900
although he is drunk.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:27.720
He falls asleep on the couch, so Sveta doesn’t
bother to wake him up and goes to sleep herself.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:31.840
When she returns to work the following day,
she is surprised to see that the woman has

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.160
already taken the friend away.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.880
Although it is her first successful sale and
she should be happy, something doesn’t feel

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:39.880
right.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.430
Just then, she gets a text from the friend.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:47.190
He has sent her a video thanking her for being
his friend even if it was only for a day.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:50.120
He even recites a self-written poem for her.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.440
Sveta is left smitten after listening to it.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:57.470
She cannot help but call his owner with the
excuse of checking up on him.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:01.840
The friend excitedly tells her that his owner
is making him wear an animal onesie.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.490
He says that he misses her before hanging
up.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:09.230
The next day at work, his owner barges in
complaining about the robot’s behavior.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:12.510
The friend follows her behind and says that
he doesn’t want to stay with her because

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:17.450
she makes him wear stupid clothes and treats
him like a slave which hurts his pride.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:22.940
Vadim Sergeevich apologizes to the customer
and ensures her a full refund.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:26.460
He is furious at the friend for making his
company look bad.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:31.590
As he hits the robot, Sveta stops him, claiming
that she will buy him instead.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:36.120
For the next few days, she collects money
from her friend Katya, her mother, and from

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:39.280
the bank and finally brings the friend home.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.980
At night, he sleeps on the floor beside her
bed.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.480
They discuss a name for him and decide on
Yegor.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:50.280
Sveta wakes up the next morning to Yegor making
her a delicious breakfast.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.570
He sends her off to work and texts her the
whole day.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.580
The two are slowly but surely falling in love.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:01.930
One evening, Sveta goes to hang out with her
best friend Katya who is expecting to be proposed

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.980
to by her boyfriend soon.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:09.600
She invites Sveta and Yegor to her birthday
party and asks her to stay in the front row,

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:12.370
confident that she is going to be proposed
to.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:17.550
One day, Yegor is alone at home when Borya
walks in and asks him who he is.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:21.570
Yegor believes that he is an intruder and
punches him in the face.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.250
He also avoids all of Borya’s attacks.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:29.200
Seeing his unique personality, Borya challenges
him to a pull-up competition and broadcasts

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.630
it live to his million followers.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.149
An innocent Yegor agrees to compete.

00:08:34.149 --> 00:08:37.659
The live video goes viral and a lot of people
join in.

00:08:37.659 --> 00:08:43.099
Sveta also sees it and rushes home to find
a drunk Borya and Yegor in the front of her

00:08:43.099 --> 00:08:44.099
building.

00:08:44.099 --> 00:08:47.430
She turns Yegor’s power off and brings him
to the apartment.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:51.490
She is furious at him for hanging out with
her ex-boyfriend without her permission.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:55.730
Yegor asks her if she is still in love with
Borya, clearly jealous.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:09:00.639
Sveta realizes how he feels and the two kiss
for the first time.

00:09:00.639 --> 00:09:04.050
That evening, they go to Katya’s birthday
party and meet her.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:08.870
Katya’s boyfriend asks her to come to the
stage but never proposes to her.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:14.000
She loses her patience and asks him for the
ring, embarrassing herself in front of everyone.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.079
Then, she runs to the back room, crying about
the horrible night.

00:09:18.079 --> 00:09:22.639
Sveta follows her behind and makes Yegor sit
with her while she goes to meet Katya’s

00:09:22.639 --> 00:09:23.639
boyfriend.

00:09:23.639 --> 00:09:27.470
Borya is also at the party showing everything
live to his followers.

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:33.240
Katya’s boyfriend tells Sveta that he is
gay which is also heard on Instagram live.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:38.339
They go to tell Katya the truth but find her
giving sexual favor to Yegor.

00:09:38.339 --> 00:09:42.120
Sveta loses her mind and hits Katya with a
bottle.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:47.010
However, she moves at the last moment and
the bottle hits Yegor, breaking his jaw.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:50.939
Sveta takes him home and invites Vit to repair
his face.

00:09:50.939 --> 00:09:55.269
Sometime later, she takes off the bandage
from his face and sees that Vit has changed

00:09:55.269 --> 00:09:57.000
his face altogether.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:02.009
Her day gets worse when she goes to the office
and gets fired because of the live video of

00:10:02.009 --> 00:10:05.209
yesterday’s event that went viral on the
internet.

00:10:05.209 --> 00:10:10.810
Even while getting fired, she asks for a new
face for Yegor but Vadim Sergeevich dismisses

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:11.810
her.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:15.560
So, she takes help from Vit and sneaks into
the warehouse at night.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:19.930
They look through the model of the boxes and
finally find the one they were looking for.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:25.089
But their plan goes south when they realize
Vadim Sergeevich has been watching them while

00:10:25.089 --> 00:10:27.330
on a bed with the model robot.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:33.079
He fires Vit from the job for bringing Sveta
in but lets them have the face for Yegor.

00:10:33.079 --> 00:10:37.769
On the ride back home, Sveta feels bad for
Vit but he assures her that he will find a

00:10:37.769 --> 00:10:39.100
new job soon.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:43.480
He is in love with her but knows that they
cannot be together because of Yegor.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:48.509
Sveta gives Yegor his old face back and the
two start living like a happy couple.

00:10:48.509 --> 00:10:53.160
They start a youtube family channel together
and turn into huge influencers because of

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.420
the uniqueness of their relationship.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:59.350
One day, Yegor proposes to Sveta on Instagram
live.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.350
She says yes and jumps around in happiness.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:07.579
In the following scene, Sveta is walking down
the aisle to marry the love of her life.

00:11:07.579 --> 00:11:09.959
The pastor is a beautiful young lady.

00:11:09.959 --> 00:11:15.310
She asks Yegor if he takes Sveta as his wife
but instead of saying yes, he flirts with

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.310
the pastor.

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:19.339
Sveta loses her patience when he asks for
her number.

00:11:19.339 --> 00:11:22.589
Humiliated at her own wedding, she runs back
home.

00:11:22.589 --> 00:11:26.709
Yegor follows her behind trying to pass his
flirting as a glitch in his program.

00:11:26.709 --> 00:11:29.019
But Sveta has made up her mind.

00:11:29.019 --> 00:11:33.769
She cries and asks him why he did that to
her but Yegor lashes out at her, calling her

00:11:33.769 --> 00:11:34.769
a weakling.

00:11:34.769 --> 00:11:40.350
Vit arrives at the right time and reveals
that error 109, is not actually an error,

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:45.970
it is a feature that every friend robot has,
because of which they mirror all the activities

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.420
of the person who first talks to them.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:52.360
So, up until now, Yegor has been mirroring
Sveta.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:57.029
He cheated on her with Katya because Sveta
wanted Katya to get over her boyfriend.

00:11:57.029 --> 00:12:00.410
Even now, he is yelling at her because she
is doing the same to him.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:04.449
Yegor realizes that he will only hurt her
if he stays in her life.

00:12:04.449 --> 00:12:10.029
So, he hands her the remote and asks her to
turn him off and send him back to Japan.

00:12:10.029 --> 00:12:13.629
They kiss for the last time before she presses
the button.

00:12:13.629 --> 00:12:18.279
Six months after the incident, Sveta wakes
up and goes to the kitchen to see Vit cooking

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:19.279
for her.

00:12:19.279 --> 00:12:22.220
He loves her more than anyone has ever had.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:26.899
While eating, she gets a text from Yegor for
the first time since they last talked.

00:12:26.899 --> 00:12:30.040
She locks herself in the bathroom and watches
the video.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.990
Yegor says he is now in Japan and is happy.

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:36.899
He also claims that he remembers all the time
they spent together because those were the

00:12:36.899 --> 00:12:38.860
best moments in his life.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:44.519
Sveta watches the video with a smile on her
face as Yegor sings for her in a Japanese

00:12:44.519 --> 00:12:45.519
warehouse.

00:12:45.519 --> 00:12:49.980
Subscribe for more videos like this, turn
on the notification, and leave a like to help

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:50.980
the channel out.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:51.569
Thanks for watching.

